     "Thank you very much. I think there may have been an error in an amendment I&#39;d made to the script ... it seems to be running now.<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Fri, Sep 14, 2012 at 6:54 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rqtl...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \r\n  <a name=\"m_2757024864228957913_139c46a5c8259e41_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Today&#39;s Topic Summary</a></div>\r\n<p>Group: <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448978910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fKvezE7Y9BJjKdJDxs6Vo\">http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/topics</a></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2757024864228957913_139c46a5c8259e41_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Question on error message with scantwo</a> [2 Updates]</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_2757024864228957913_139c46a5c8259e41_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/t/fcd1bbcf8efbbd0f\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/t/fcd1bbcf8efbbd0f&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448978910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2iDGI3upBZVj7-PikxVoCr\">Question on error message with scantwo</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">HASmith &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hasmith...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Sep 13 03:11PM -0700\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Hi,<br>\r\nI am analyzing a binary trait with rqtl, and while scanone works, I obtain <br>\r\nan error message with scantwo that I do not understand. I would greatly <br>\r\nappreciate any insight on why this is\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/msg/a49fa4e8e47491b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/msg/a49fa4e8e47491b8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448978910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16uY2X2ilOzbTFO4l58K1_\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Karl Broman &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kbr...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Sep 13 10:37PM -0400\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Try running scantwo with argument assumeCondIndep=TRUE<br>\r\n <br>\r\nscantwo uses the joint genotype probabilities at two positions, <br>\r\ngiven the marker data. I suspect that these calculations are \r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/msg/9a5cceff7b7001a0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/msg/9a5cceff7b7001a0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448978910000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ZYSWIBdTIf_KLyMjadSDx\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"color:#555555;padding:27px 0 0 40px\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Group rqtl-disc.<br>\r\n    You can <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">post via email</a>.<br>\r\n    To unsubscribe from this group, <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">send</a> an empty message.<br>\r\n    For more options, <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448978911000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tjLxIfhUBvmpG12dhiYYg\">visit</a> this group.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n  </font></span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;R/qtl discussion&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rqtl...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rqtl-disc+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n\r\nFor more options, visit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc?hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448978911000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Lcrd65CWgV-qrF1GtWs7N\">http://groups.google.com/group/rqtl-disc?hl=en</a>.<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div><br><br clear=\"all\"><br>-- <br>Dr. Hilary April Smith<br>Postdoctoral Research Associate<br>Department of Biological Sciences<br>University of Notre Dame<br><br><br>\r\n"
